ated by AlanoGames is completely unintentional and coincidental.",ctn_10:"AlanoGames may promote the issuance and circulation of $ALANO in a decentralized manner through airdrops in the future. AlanoGames will not and does not intend to conduct any ICO, so $ALANO is a commodity rather than a security.",ctn_11:"The user agrees that $ALANO may have no value, $ALANO does not provide any guarantee or representation of value or liquidity, and $ALANO is not an investment product and is not used for any speculative investment. When making any decision to acquire any $ALANO, you must not rely on any statement on the AlanoGames website or white paper.",ctn_12:"The user agrees that any description, listing behavior, promise or guarantee made by any third-party platform, including but not limited to centralized exchanges, on AlanoGames and $ALANO, can be regarded as false news before obtaining the written consent of AlanoGames. AlanoGames is not responsible for such behavior.",ctn_13:"Security measures: We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, use and disclosure. However, we cannot guarantee that your information is 100% secure because no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure.",ctn_14:"Your rights: You have the right to access, update and delete your personal information, as well as to object to or restrict certain processing of your information. You also have the right to withdraw your consent at any time, where applicable. Please contact us to exercise these rights.",ctn_15:"Cookies and similar technologies: We use cookies and similar technologies to collect information about your use of our platform and personalize your experience. You can manage your cookie preferences through browser settings.",tip:"Changes to this policy: We may update this policy from time to time. We will notify you of any significant changes to the policy by posting the new policy on our platform."},verification:{title:"Fairness Verification",outline_1:"Introduction to asymmetric encryption algorithms",ctn_1_1:"Asymmetric encryption algorithms are publicly verified algorithms that require two keys to interact with each other: public keys and private keys. The public key and the private key are a pair. If the data is encrypted with the public key, it can only be decrypted with the corresponding private key. Because encryption and decryption use two different keys (i.e., public key and private key), it is called an asymmetric encryption algorithm.",ctn_1_2:"The basic process of implementing confidential information exchange with an asymmetric encryption algorithmis: Party A generates a pair of keys and makes the public key public. Other roles (Party B) who need to send information to Party A use the public key to encrypt the confidential information and then send it to Party A. Then Party A uses its own private key to decrypt the encrypted information. When Party A wants to reply to Party B, it is just the opposite. It uses Party B's public key to encrypt the data. Similarly, Party B uses its own private key to decrypt it.",ctn_1_3:"On the other hand, Party A can use its own private key to sign confidential information and then send it to Party B; Party B then uses Party A's public key to verify the signature of the data sent back by Party A. Party A can use its private key to decrypt any information encrypted by its public key.",outline_2:"Define the effective period for running asymmetric algorithms",ctn_2_1:"After the official game betting is over, everyone's betting situation (betting amount and betting options) has been determined, publicly known and irreversible, so the platform cannot modify this part of the data;",ctn_2_2:"After the official game betting stage is over, before the official game officially starts, the asymmetric encryption algorithm can be operated to obtain the random number of the game lottery result;",outline_3:"AlanoGames' game random number acquisition process",ctn_3_1:'After the betting is over and before the game officially starts, that is, within the "qualified time period" mentioned above, the following process will be carried out in steps:',ctn_3_2:"AlanoGames server first generates a seed A, at which time A is in the state of a private key.",ctn_3_3:"AlanoGames encrypts A with the MD5 algorithm to obtain a 32-bit encrypted hash AH, which will be made public to everyone.",ctn_3_4:"Generate a seed B through the public key contract on the blockchain, at which time B is in the state of a public key, and B will be made public to everyone.",ctn_3_5:"Perform asymmetric encryption algorithm conversion, convert A and B to get the result C, at this time C is the random number based on the lottery result of this game.",outline_4:"How do users verify?",ctn_4_1:"After the game is over, AlanoGames will disclose the private key A, and the user can encrypt A through MD5 to get a hash. Compare this hash with AH. If the two hash values are consistent, it can be confirmed that the value of A has not been tampered with throughout the process.",ctn_4_2:"Players can get the verification result by putting seeds A and B into the verification contract. Compare this result with C. If the two values are consistent, it can be confirmed that the entire game process is fair.",ctn_4_3:"Players use the verification contract and need to pay a certain amount of Gas to the corresponding blockchain network according to the actual situation of the blockchain network.",ctn_4_4:"The above rules are only applicable to the current system version. AlanoGames will continue to upgrade more comprehensive and advanced rules in subsequent updated versions. Please refer to the latest version of this page.",form_label_1:"GAMES",form_label_2:"Server Seed",form_label_3:"The open network Last masterchain blocks Root hash",verify:"verify",explode:"Explode",final_result:"Final Result",banker:"Banker",player:"Player",points:"Points",process_label_1:"Server seed Base64 conversion he